  "description": "**“I think Lina and I… might have been scammed.”**\n\nStruggling to make ends meet with barely enough for one semester’s tuition, they're now on the brink of losing everything.\n\nTo win a massive cash prize, they decide to team up with a talented game developer named Wonil and create a game together. But as the story unfolds… something about this game feels eerily familiar.\n\nA game that will change everything over the course of 100 days. A romance that transcends realities—between a modern-day campus and a fantasy academy.\n\n(Source: MangaDex)\n___\n**Original Webtoon:**  \n[KakaoPage](https://page.kakao.com/content/63956937), [Daum](https://webtoon.kakao.com/content/%ED%8F%89%ED%96%89%EC%84%A0%EC%9D%98-100%EC%9D%BC/4042)",
